                , Program testing and the meaning explanations of intuitionistic type theory. In Dybjer, P., Lindström, S., Palmgren, E., and Sundholm,
              %p
                G., editors.
                = succeed "." do
                  %em Epistemology Versus Ontology
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/978-94-007-4435-6_11"} doi:10.1007/978-94-007-4435-6_11
